Marker only - see CONTRIBUTING.md. build() is hand-written: reuses the
real busybox's .config (main/busybox/scraplinux.config) built with
CC="clang -m32", installed under a distinct usr/lib32/scraplinux/busybox32
path/name so it cannot collide with or be mistaken for the real PID1
busybox.
gen-ports.py must never regenerate over this.
